<section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Shipping & Delivery</span><h1>Shipping and Production Lead Time</h1><p>Products, customizations and delivery locations vary, so the lead time and delivery cost are confirmed for each order.</p></div></section><section class="container section-space info-page"><div class="process-list"><div><span>01</span><h2>Choose the Product</h2><p>Send the product link, quantity and any requested size or color changes.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h2>Confirm the Address</h2><p>Share the governorate, area, delivery conditions and access details.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h2>Confirm Time and Cost</h2><p>The team confirms availability, production lead time and delivery cost.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h2>Coordinate Delivery</h2><p>Nestica contacts you to arrange the final date and receiving instructions.</p></div></div></section><section class="container info-alert"><i class="bi bi-truck"></i><div><h2>Important</h2><p>The displayed product price does not automatically include delivery or customization. Request a written final summary before confirmation.</p></div></section>
